# Work-rig snapshot (nested git repo, branch quarantine-work-dump-* pushed to origin).
# Its engine-split architecture + WS1/WS2 research were adopted onto main 2026-07-01
# (see CHANGELOG). Kept locally as a reference for the remaining WS3-WS6 items; safe to
# delete once those are ported. Ignored so it never gets committed into the outer repo.
zerobreach/

# Native Tauri shell (native-app/) — Rust/Node build output, never source.
# Icons ARE committed (tauri.conf.json's bundle.icon requires them present to build) —
# only android/ios variants `tauri icon` also generates are excluded, this app is Windows-only.
# Cargo.lock IS committed too — this is an application, not a library; pinned deps matter for
# a security tool's supply-chain consistency.
native-app/node_modules/
native-app/dist/
native-app/src-tauri/target/
native-app/src-tauri/icons/android/
native-app/src-tauri/icons/ios/
native-app/src-tauri/gen/

# Sandbox test harness scratch (tools/sandbox-test/) - staged payloads, downloaded malware
# samples, screenshots and JSON reports from Invoke-SandboxTest.ps1 runs. Only the harness/
# orchestrator scripts themselves are committed.
tools/sandbox-test/work/

